1.01,0:02:01.00,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:51.80,0:01:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D. mi?Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.43,0:02:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün seninle tanışacağım hiç aklıma gelmezdi.Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.14,0:02:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"O-Oden"...Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.02,0:02:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babamın defteri mi o?Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.56,0:02:12.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dolu dolu yaşantısı ve dünyayı keşfinin tüm ayrıntıları bu defterde yer alıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.74,0:02:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Malum gün, bunu Oden Kalesi'nin oradaki nehirden aldım.Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.58,0:02:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biri bunu yangından kurtarmış.Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.16,0:02:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'nın...Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.42,0:02:25.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.88,0:02:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seninle ilgili de birçok şey yazıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.76,0:02:35.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal'ın gemisinde doğmuşsun!Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.97,0:02:37.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonra da Roger'ın gemisine gitmişsin.Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.01,0:02:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hıhı.Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.93,0:02:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama çok küçük olduğumdan hiç hatırlamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.23,0:02:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal, Roger ve Oden.Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.07,0:02:53.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortak bir şey söylediler...Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.28,0:02:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortak bir şey söylediler...Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.32,0:02:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortak bir şey söylediler...Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.40,0:02:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortak bir şey söylediler...Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.44,0:02:53.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortak bir şey söylediler...Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Bundan en az 20 yıl sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.25,0:03:06.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,genç ve güçlü korsanlar birbiri ardına Yeni Dünya'ya gelecek."Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O vakit geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onların başının da Ace olacağına inanıyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.88,0:03:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o öldüğünde bir şeyi hatırladım. O gece dediği bir şeyi!Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.56,0:03:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne...?Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.77,0:03:30.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hass...Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.15,0:03:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağzımdan kaçırdım!Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.73,0:03:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlışlıkla söyledim.Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu demedim sayalım!Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.70,0:03:38.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak gülme,Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.70,0:03:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo'yla ben çok kızarız.Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.49,0:03:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşimin hayali bu.Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.88,0:03:54.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy bunu dediğinde Sabo'yla gülmüştük.Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.76,0:03:58.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama başkasının gülmesine izin vermeyiz.Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona inanıyoruz çünkü.Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.76,0:04:03.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onda bu potansiyel var, bu yüzden–Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.51,0:04:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.39,0:04:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.15,0:04:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyin var, Yamato?Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.52,0:04:16.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben gülmeyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.24,0:04:20.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı da aynısını demişti!Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.74,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden de çok etkilenmişti!Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.74,0:04:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolculuğu sırasında Kozuki Oden de aynısını diyen büyük bir adam görmüş.Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta gülmem!Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.58,0:04:33.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşin inanılmaz biri!Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.46,0:04:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük adam ha?Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.09,0:04:38.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyiymiş.Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.59,0:04:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'yle beraber bir gün onunla içeriz umarım.Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.22,0:04:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aranızdan su sızmazdı kesin.Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.97,0:04:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çoktan ölmeseydi.Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.23,0:04:48.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öldü mü?Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.85,0:04:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yazık oldu. Kadeh tokuşturamayacağız.Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.66,0:05:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bitirdim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu senin vivre kartın.Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.03,0:05:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu muymuş?Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.54,0:05:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bildiğin kağıt parçası bu ya.Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.75,0:05:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, bu kağıt parçası bizi tekrar bir araya getirecek.Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.26,0:05:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrılmak istemediğin ya da tekrar görmek istediğin birine bundan bir parça ver.Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.76,0:05:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anladım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.64,0:05:25.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle yaparım.Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.37,0:05:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.59,0:06:03.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar görüşelim...Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.05,0:06:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette!Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.15,0:06:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.07,0:06:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu onu son görüşümdü.Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.42,0:06:40.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O gün dış dünyada neler olup bittiğini bilmesem de...Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.42,0:06:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,olanları daha sonra gazeteden okudum.Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.76,0:06:49.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace'in Korsanlar Kralı Gol D. Roger'ın oğlu olduğunu...Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.14,0:06:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve kardeşinin cidden korsan olup nam yaptığını öğrendim.Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.52,0:06:59.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşi senin buraya getirdiğin Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.78,0:07:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun.Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.61,0:07:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hakkın olarak bunu sana veriyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.57,0:07:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in gelecek ile ilgili kaleme aldıkları bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.84,0:07:23.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bundan en az 20 yıl sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.05,0:07:35.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,gelecek çağa öncülük edecek genç ve güçlü korsanlar, birbiri ardına Yeni Dünya'ya gelecek.Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.73,0:07:39.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şayet ölürsem...Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.11,0:07:39.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şayet ölürsem...Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.23,0:07:39.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şayet ölürsem...Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yu...Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.66,0:07:49.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,onlar devirecek!Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.24,0:07:52.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biri daha geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.24,0:07:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz oturun, ben hallederim.Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.50,0:07:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reddediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.00,0:07:55.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de.Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.37,0:07:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kellesini almalık ne çok kişi geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka.Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.31,0:08:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Linlin!Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.56,0:08:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bil bakalım bu velet karşıma geçip ne olacağım demiştir.Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.32,0:08:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Küstahın teki.Dialogue: 50,0:08:28.24,0:08:31.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana da haddini aşan sözler söyledi.Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.82,0:08:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalemi de yerle bir etti.Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.45,0:08:38.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önce özür dile, Hasır Şapka.Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan velet.Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.84,0:08:49.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karşımızdayken...Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.68,0:08:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ne olacaksın bir daha söyle hele!Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.15,0:09:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misin, Kin'emon?Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.86,0:09:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özür dilerim.Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geç kaldım.Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.21,0:09:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P... Perişanım.Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.92,0:09:28.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öteki...Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dünyada...Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.76,0:09:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,efendime bakacak yüzüm... yok!Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.31,0:09:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'e–Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.48,0:09:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'ya...Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.73,0:09:47.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sahip çıkar mısın?Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.40,0:09:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya–Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.03,0:09:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette çıkarım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.20,0:09:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası dostlarımın ülkesi!Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan velet.Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.09,0:10:10.09,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono...Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.26,0:10:14.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,minnettarım.Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.18,0:10:16.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trao!Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.97,0:10:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsini aşağıya yolla!Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.65,0:10:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine ne sarsıntısı bu?Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.69,0:10:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.57,0:10:38.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin haki dediğiniz şey Wano'da ryuo olarak biliniyor.Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.03,0:10:40.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,"Akış" anlamına geliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.91,0:10:44.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama idam edildi!Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.12,0:10:48.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano şogunu tarafından, korsan Kaido'nun da yardımıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.34,0:10:48.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano şogunu tarafından, korsan Kaido'nun da yardımıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.38,0:10:48.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano şogunu tarafından, korsan Kaido'nun da yardımıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.42,0:10:48.46,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano şogunu tarafından, korsan Kaido'nun da yardımıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.92,0:10:51.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono güvende!Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.84,0:10:48.88,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono güvende!Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.88,0:10:48.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono güvende!Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.09,0:10:53.38,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.38,0:10:53.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== We'd never sell out our friends! ===Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.38,0:10:53.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.42,0:10:53.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.47,0:10:53.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.51,0:10:53.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.55,0:10:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== We'd never sell out our friends! ===Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.80,0:10:56.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.55,0:10:53.59,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.59,0:10:53.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.63,0:10:53.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.67,0:10:53.72,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.72,0:10:53.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.76,0:10:53.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.55,0:11:00.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ebisu Kasabası'nın neşeli adamı öteki dünyaya göçmek üzere!Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.51,0:10:56.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ebisu Kasabası'nın neşeli adamı öteki dünyaya geçmek üzere!Dialogue: 51,0:11:00.76,0:11:00.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ebisu Kasabası'nın neşeli adamı öteki dünyaya geçmek üzere!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.76,0:11:04.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Henüz isyan ateşi sönmemiş demek.Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.06,0:11:06.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm gemiler, Onigashima'ya!Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.10,0:11:07.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,İleri!Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.90,0:11:13.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,20 yıl önce Oden, Kaido tarafından öldürüldüğünde...Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.82,0:11:16.24,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,bu ülke duraklama çağına girmedi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.24,0:11:19.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimse ölürken gülünmeyi hak etmez.Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.37,0:11:22.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yabancıyım diye ülkeyi kurtaramaz mıyım?Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.66,0:11:25.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Konuşsana! Önemli biri değil miydin?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.16,0:11:28.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu harika insanların lideri değil misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.54,0:11:32.71,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yu devirmek istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.22,0:11:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızıl...Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.94,0:11:48.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaya!Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaido! Ne yapıyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.67,0:12:18.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen yere düşmezsin!Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.80,0:12:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben, Monkey D. Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.43,0:12:26.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi geride bırakacak...Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.65,0:12:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve Korsanlar Kralı olacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zenginlik, şöhret, güç...Dialogue: 50,0:00:03.73,0:00:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyanın sunabileceği her şeyi elde eden adam, Korsanlar Kralı, Gold Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:00:07.99,0:00:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son sözleri dünyanın her yerinden maceracıları denize çekti.Dialogue: 50,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazinem mi?Dialogue: 50,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstiyorsanız, alabilirsiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arayıp bulun!Dialogue: 50,0:00:16.83,0:00:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu dünyanın sunabileceği her şeyi orada bıraktım!Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.75,0:00:26.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık herkes, hayallerinin peşinde Grand Line'a yelken açıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.55,0:00:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünya, Büyük Korsan Çağı'na girdi!Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,ıDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,